# Terraform / OpenTofu working files
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
crash.log
crash.*.log
tfplan
# Provider lock is generated by CI's `terraform init`; not committing the locally
# generated (OpenTofu) lock to avoid registry-hash mismatches.
.terraform.lock.hcl
